{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100321","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100321/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100321/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100321/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100321","id":2736221774,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FCSJn","number":100321,"title":"Render Pass Optimization from TheForge","user":{"login":"darksylinc","id":3395130,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTUxMzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3395130?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc","html_url":"https://github.com/darksylinc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darksylinc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1007033697,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDA3MDMzNjk3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/salvageable","name":"salvageable","color":"ff7766","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2024-12-12T15:26:11Z","updated_at":"2025-01-11T08:54:39Z","closed_at":"2025-01-11T01:30:29Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100321","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100321","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100321.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100321.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The work was performed by collaboration of TheForge and Google. I am merely splitting it up into smaller PRs and cleaning it up.\r\n\r\nBefore this PR Godot was doing the following (when rendering to the SHADOW MAP):\r\n\r\nTo the whole atlas:\r\n\r\n1. BeingPass - Clear\r\n2. EndPass - Store (that's it, it just clears the shadow map)\r\n3. Light [i] BeginPass - Load\r\n4. SetViewport( atlas_region[i] )\r\n5. Draw calls.\r\n6. Light [i] EndPass - Store\r\n7. Go to step 3 until all lights have been rendered.\r\n\r\nAfter this PR Godot now does the following:\r\n\r\n1. BeginPass - Clear\r\n2. SetViewport( atlas_region[i] )\r\n3. Draw calls.\r\n4. Go to step 2 until all lights have been rendered.\r\n5. EndPass - Store\r\n\r\nThat's a massive optimization for mobile.\r\n\r\nI may even argue we should port this optimization to Forward+ (the impact should be much lower though since Desktops are immediate mode renderers, except macOS & iPhone which are powerful enough to run the Forward+ but are tilers).\r\n\r\nHowever there's also to consider that on Desktop it might be a loss because the Clear gets reordered and internally AMD a Clear means a Compute barrier; thus may change how effective asynchronous async compute ends up being (in practice). But if that's a loss or win, I've got no idea.\r\n\r\nI've added a comment to the Forward+ implementation to document why the clear is happening there.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, Godot's Render Graph now tracks if the draw or compute lists are empty. If there's nothing to be done, it skips work.\r\n\r\n### Toggle\r\n\r\n - `bool render_pass_opts_enabled = true`\r\n\r\nThis boolean reverts the shadow map behavior.\r\n\r\nUseful for debugging bugs and regressions.\r\n\r\nThere's no other reason for this boolean. Possibly once it becomes well tested, the boolean could be removed entirely.\r\n\r\n# Video\r\n\r\n## Before\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e42dc3d1-0c91-41a8-aeed-0f26081a6991\r\n\r\n\r\n## After\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4199600d-d144-4a19-b421-01d6f0981ed4\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100321/reactions","total_count":15,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":4,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100321/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}